    <div class="sec-body">
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p><span>For the purposes of applying the Mandatory Inclusionary Housing Program provisions set forth in Section <a class="sec-link-inline" target="_blank" href="/article-ii/chapter-7#27-10"><span>27-10</span></a> (ADMINISTRATION OF AFFORDABLE HOUSING), inclusive, <strong><em>Mandatory Inclusionary Housing areas</em></strong> within the <strong><em>Special Jerome Corridor District</em></strong> are shown on the maps in APPENDIX F of this Resolution.</span></p>
