</div>
            <div class="action-link"><a data-content-nid="20135" data-section-number="141-25" data-section-title="Special Height and Setback Regulations in R8A Districts" title="Amendment History" class="use-ajax action-icon revisions" href="/nojs/get/amendment/section/20135">History</a></div>
            <div class="action-link"><a data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Download PDF" class="action-icon print" href="/entityprint/pdf/node/20135" target="_blank">Print Section</a></div>
            <div class="action-link"><a data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="left" title="Copy Link" class="action-icon link">Copy Link</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="action-link-content hidden">
            <div class="share-link">https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-xiv/chapter-1/141-25</div>
        </div>
    </div>

        <div class="section-annotations">
        <div class="views-element-container"><div class="view view-section-annotations view-id-section_annotations view-display-id-block_1 js-view-dom-id-774d6158f8ab6ebd49a0450f93343f910eb7b0f12ec859152330bb7ac9ee1f66">
  
    
      
  
          </div>
</div>

    </div>

    <div class="sec-body">
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p><span>For <strong><em>zoning lots</em></strong> in R8A Districts, or in <strong><em>Commercial Districts</em></strong> mapped within, or with a <strong><em>residential equivalent</em></strong> of an R8A District, within 100 feet of a <strong><em>wide street</em></strong> located outside of <strong><em>Mandatory Inclusionary Housing areas</em></strong>, the underlying height and setback provisions applicable to an R8 District within 100 feet of a <strong><em>wide street</em></strong> shall apply. However, <strong><em>sky exposure plane buildings</em></strong> shall not be permitted, and the additional height allowances for eligible sites set forth in Section <a class="sec-link-inline" target="_blank" href="/article-ii/chapter-3#23-434"><span>23-434</span></a> (Height and setback modifications for eligible sites) shall not apply.</span></p>
</div>
      
          </div>

</article>





    </div>


