        <div class="views-element-container"><div class="view view-section-annotations view-id-section_annotations view-display-id-block_1 js-view-dom-id-bc6bac093579efdc3f0454da3791e1561338a55c9fc0ca3a256aa3ebe6fff398">
  
    
      
  
          </div>
</div>

    </div>

    <div class="sec-body">
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p><span>In all districts, for <strong><em>zoning lots</em></strong> existing on March 22, 2018, with frontage along Edward L. Grant Highway, West 170th Street, or the portions of Jerome or River Avenues with an elevated rail structure, and fronting along other <strong><em>streets</em></strong>, no curb cut accessing off-street parking spaces or loading spaces shall be permitted along such <strong><em>streets</em></strong>, as applicable.</span></p></div>
      
          </div>

</article>





